 # Inventory Stock Risk Prediction

A Machine Learning web application that predicts inventory stock risk to help identify potential overstock and stockout situations.

## Project Overview

This project uses historical inventory-related features to predict whether an item is at risk of **overstock** or **stockout**. The application provides an interactive interface built with Streamlit.

## Features

- Predict inventory stock risk using a trained Machine Learning model.
- Accept inventory, demand, supplier, and seasonal inputs.
- Display predictions through an interactive web application.
- Support inventory planning and stock management decisions.

## Technologies Used

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- Joblib
- Streamlit

## Machine Learning Models

The following classification algorithms were evaluated:

| Model | Accuracy |
|---|---:|
| Logistic Regression | 99.4% |
| Decision Tree | 98.6% |
| Random Forest | 98.6% |

Logistic Regression achieved the highest accuracy on the evaluated dataset.

