## How to Run Locally

1. Clone this repository.
2. Install the dependencies:

   ```bash
   pip install -r requirements.txt
   ```

3. Run the application:

   ```bash
   streamlit run app.py
   ```

## Project Objective

The goal is to demonstrate how Machine Learning can support inventory management by identifying stock risks and helping businesses make more informed inventory decisions.

